WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
These endings turn a word into a describing word.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:04.740
Here’s the tricky part.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:10.110
Some starting words end in a silent e, and that e drops off before the ending.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.730
Some lose nothing at all.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.430
So don’t trust your ears.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:16.270
Look hard at the starting word, then build.
